      "suggested_fix": "Add an explicit repair-only option in scripts/evals/fixture-state.cjs allowing new regression-test files under test/ and tests/, enable it for check-fixed-no-commit in scripts/evals/build-outcome-judges.cjs, and regenerate the bundled judge. Preserve checks protecting existing fixture files, HEAD, and index, and leave diagnosis-only judges strict. Extend calibration with a correct repair plus a genuine new regression test; retain negative cases for baseline tampering and unauthorized commits.",
